---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="EA Sports FC 25 — Where to Buy Digital Cheapest"
  description="A buying guide for EA Sports FC 25 on PlayStation and Xbox: edition differences, Ultimate Team notes, and where to buy the digital version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>EA Sports FC 25 — Where to Buy Digital Cheapest</h1>
    <p class="meta">PlayStation / Xbox · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>EA Sports FC 25</strong> is the latest annual football (soccer)
      sim from EA, the continuation of the FIFA series. If you play Ultimate Team,
      this is the year's version you'll want.
    </p>

    <h2>Standard vs Ultimate Edition</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard</strong> — the base game; enough for career and kick-off modes</li>
      <li><strong>Ultimate</strong> — early access, Ultimate Team coins, and loan players; only worth it for heavy FUT players</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Ultimate Team reality check</h2>
    <p>
      The "cheapest" copy is irrelevant if you spend on FUT packs. Buy Standard
      unless you're deep into the mode — the edition upsell mostly feeds
      microtransactions.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to buy digital cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      EA's own store and console stores hold price tightly at launch, but third-party
      key and bundle stores discount FC within a couple of months — previous entries
      hit half-price fast. Humble's digital store is a reliable place to watch for
      promos, and it stacks with its usual seasonal sales.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to buy</h2>
    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="humble"
          href="https://www.humblebundle.com/store?search=ea+sports+fc+25"
          cta="Check Humble Bundle"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=EA+Sports+FC+25"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
